        {
          "type": "starrailexpress:role_panel",
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "parameters": {
            "title": "ponder.starrailexpress.label.notes",
            "lines": [
              {
                "en_us": "The Wayfarer can approach a corpse to read extra killer info (affected by the Vulture and Arsonist); here you may trigger the skill (right-click the corpse) to turn the fake knife into a one-use knife and gain that corpse's key and letter (once only)",
                "zh_cn": "红尘客可靠近尸体读取额外的凶手信息（会受到秃鹫与纵火犯的影响），此时可选择发动技能（右键尸体），激活假刀变为一次性刀，获得该尸体的钥匙与信件（仅触发一次）",
                "zh_tw": "紅塵客可靠近屍體讀取額外的兇手資訊（會受到禿鷲與縱火犯的影響），此時可選擇發動技能（右鍵屍體），啟動假刀變為一次性刀，獲得該屍體的鑰匙與信件（僅觸發一次）"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The Wayfarer can approach a corpse to read extra killer info (affected by the Vulture and Arsonist); here you may trigger the skill (right-click the corpse) to turn the fake knife into a one-use knife and gain that corpse's key and letter (once only)",
